            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 151476,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>HTML ti permette di strutturare una pagina web: titoli, testo, pulsanti, immagini e altro.</p><p>Fai clic sul frammento di codice <code>&lt;h1&gt;Hello, World!&lt;/h1&gt;</code> per aggiungerlo all'editor di codice. Poi fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto per visualizzare la pagina web.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;h1&gt;Hello, World!&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 151478,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le pagine web di solito contengono più di un'intestazione.</p><p>Fai clic sui frammenti di codice per formare <code>&lt;p&gt;Welcome to my website.&lt;/p&gt;</code> nell'editor di codice. Poi fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to my website.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;p&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>Welcome to my website.</code> e infine <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 151479,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I pulsanti permettono ai visitatori di interagire con la tua pagina web.</p><p>Fai clic sui frammenti di codice per formare <code>&lt;button&gt;My projects&lt;/button&gt;</code> e aggiungere un pulsante alla pagina web. Poi fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto per vedere il risultato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to my website.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My projects\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>My projects</code> e infine <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
